[snip]

The KRQ50 is capable of connecting to two RRD40/50 drives. The first 10
wires, counting the ribbon cable conductors from the striped end, go to
the first drive. The second set of ten go to the second drive.

Using a suitable length of ribbon cable (split 10 conductors out of a
wider cable?) align the striped end with the pin 1 arrowheads on both
the 20 pin and DB15 connectors and crunch.

Jeff



