Hi all,

Today I switched on my uVAX3300 and the disk didn't start.
I have one RF31 connected to the onboard DSSI controller (KA640), but a
SHOW DEV only returns
DSSI Node 6 (*)

it doesn't show DIA0 anymore.
Also, there is no activity on the patch panel (KA-70), the READY LED
doesn't light, and the disk doesn't make the seek sound.
If I remove the DSSI cable of the disk connector, then the seek noise
returns and the LEDs flash, like in normal boot up time.
I've tested with other disks and double checked cabling: same result.

Have I lost the controller?

Please help.

