Does the bell ring   ?

I am not sure that VMS boots if there is no console device. I remember once
that VMS didn't boot because the terminal was on hold-screen.

Have you tried changing terminals ?  I would suspect a blown screen more than
a blown OPA0 controller. When you turn on the terminal, does it display
anything ?

This may sound silly, but you are aware that the connector on the machine is
not a PC serial connector but a proprietary Digital connector. At the time of
the Microvax II, PC's didn't yet use those 9 pin connectors.

 (The battery is for the clock BTW).



