subsets.  All of a sudden, the gendisk script does not work and I get
the following error:

DECthreads init failure, version mismatch:
        kernel version 1, library version 10001 -- application must be
relinked.
expr: syntax error

The gendisk script worked the last time I ran it about 2 weeks ago.
