It sounds like your escape key isn't sending just an escape.
You are probibly getting something like <esc>[~Z (not sure what
letter), where the escape kicks you out of insert mode, and the
~ switches case, and whatever letter is there doesn't do anything
visible.

Check the terminal settings (F3 key), under keybpard settings, and
see if you have anything odd there.

