From: "Terry C. Shannon" <shannon@world.std.com>
Subject: Need a Reason to Attend ICUS (DECUS) San Diego? Here's 10 to Choose From...
Date: 1999/10/24
Message-ID: <FK4LtL.u1@world.std.com>
