The part numbers for the two PSU fans are:

180W psu fan =12-24701-35. This has built in speed control.
210W psu fan =12-42092-01   
The fans and PSU operate the temp control in different ways and cannot be
mixed. Check which PSU you have first. Hint: the 180W does not have a
thermal sensor or a system fan power cable. Then again you could just read
the label...

Hope this helps. 

