The issue is not the version of PW on your PC, but rather the version of
PW server running on your VAX.  Information on PW server can be found at
http://www.openvms.digital.com/pathworks/index.html.  The following is
taken from this site:

V5.0F1 supports OpenVMS V7.1 (both VAX and Alpha) as well
                   as earlier versions of OpenVMS as follows: 

                        OpenVMS Alpha Operating System V6.1, V6.2, V7.0,
and
                        V7.1 
                        OpenVMS VAX Operating System V5.5-2, V6.1, V6.2,
                        V7.0, and V7.1 

It looks like your options are limited since PW 5.0f is what you need. 
You might be able to get a version of 5.0 up on your VAX, but I would
not count on it.

Thomas Wirt
Indianapolis, Indiana

