Bill,

The only way to review the data on that tape is to restore it on a VMS
system (VAX or Alpha).  Of course it must have RDB installed.

    1. Mount the tape foreign
    2. Dump the database header to determine where the database will be
restored (devices or logicals)
    3. Set the VMS system appropriately
    4. Restore the database.
    5. At this point you can extract the data to flat files and move them to
your NT system...

Jeff

